#. 今日は、石丸君と霧切さんがいないのですね…
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Taka and Kyoko are not here today..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切っちは見張りだべ。
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Kyoko's still on guard duty, probably."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸に関しては…わからんな…
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I have no idea about Taka..."
msgstr ""

#. ふん、放っておきゃいーんですよ…
#. あんなのッ！
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "May as well just forget about that guy!"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…珍しくご立腹だね…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You don't have to get so mad..."
msgstr ""

#. しょうがねーべ、恋敵だべ。
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "They're rivals in love. What're ya gonna do...?"
msgstr ""

#. あんな童貞と一緒にしないでいただきたいッ！
#. 童貞がうつりますから！
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Don't put me on the same level as that...that...\n"
"virgin! I might catch his virginity!"
msgstr ""

#. うつるもなにも、オメーだって絶対そうだべ…
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Nah, my guess is you're already infected..."
msgstr ""

#. て言うか、うつるの！？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, can you really catch it!?"
msgstr ""

#. …下品な話題はやめにして、朝食を頂きましょう。
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid "Stop being vulgar. Let's eat breakfast."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、いざ目の前の食事に手を付けようとした、
#. その時だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But as soon as my hands approached my food...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ゲラゲラゲラゲラ！
msgctxt "0012 | NO NAME"
msgid "...Kyeehaha!"
msgstr ""

#. …え？　今の声って…
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? That voice..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>直後、食堂のドアが勢いよく開かれ、
#. そこから姿を現したのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The doors to the dining hall exploded open, and a\n"
"figure appeared...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. やはりお前か、ジェノサイダー翔…
#. それに…
msgctxt "0016 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "So it's you, Genocide Jack. And..."
msgstr ""

#. なぜ一緒にいるかなど聞かなくていいぞ。
#. 答えるのすら、くだらない…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't bother asking why we arrived at the same time.\n"
"The answer should be obvious."
msgstr ""

#. ヒントは…
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I'll give you a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 今朝のアタシは赤いランジェリーなのッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I'm wearing red lingerie today!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、聞いてないけど…
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Umm...I don't think anyone wanted to know..."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、アンタッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hold on a second! You...!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何…？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "H-Huh...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦闘力は上から、８８・５７・８４…
#. 着やせするタイプだなッ！！
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"What's your top power level, like 35-22-33!? You start\n"
"out big on top to try and look thinner down south!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、おっぱいデカいって！
#. 牛乳風呂で染み込ませてんの！？
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Look at your melons! They're seriously gargantuan! Do\n"
"you dunk 'em in milk every night or something!?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、怖い…！
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Y-You're starting to freak me out...!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈に触れたら…許さぬぞ…！
msgctxt "0026 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you lay a finger on Hina...I will show you no\n"
"mercy!"
msgstr ""

#. で、用件はなんですか？
msgctxt "0027 | CELES"
msgid "So? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#. わたくし達と食事を共にする為に
#. 来た訳ではないのでしょう？
msgctxt "0028 | CELES"
msgid "Surely you are not here to join us for breakfast."
msgstr ""

#. 当然だ。
#. 話を聞きに来ただけだ。
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Of course not. I came to hear a story."
msgstr ""

#. 話…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A story...?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺に説明していない話があるはずだぞ…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "A story that nobody's bothered to tell me yet."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって…アルターエゴの件だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are you talking about...Alter Ego?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …悪いが、今は話せんな。
msgctxt "0033 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Sorry, but we can't talk about that right now."
msgstr ""

#. なぜだ…？
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

#. 色々と事情があるのだ。
msgctxt "0035 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Because of certain...circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. 今まで、ずっと知らん顔しといて、
#. いきなり教えろってのも都合がよすぎんべ？
msgctxt "0036 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Up till now you haven't given a crap about anything,\n"
"and *now* you're all concerned? I don't buy it."
msgstr ""

#. 決めたぞ。ここから出たらお前は鳥葬だ。
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've just made a decision. When we get out of here,\n"
"I'm going to feed your body to the vultures."
msgstr ""

#. どんな独裁者だべ！？
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What kind of messed up dictator are you!?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、大した民主主義だな。
#. 自分達の意にそぐわない者には情報すら与えんのか…
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But isn't this a democracy? Or would you exclude those\n"
"who don't fit into your tyrannical majority?"
msgstr ""

#. べ、別にそんなつもりじゃ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That's not what we're doing..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、いいさ。
#. だったら、石丸の事を教えてもらおうか。
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. If nothing else, tell me what's going\n"
"on with Taka."
msgstr ""

#. 昨日たまたま、あいつを見かけたんだが、
#. 何か様子がおかしかったんで気になっているんだ。
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When I saw him yesterday, I happened to notice\n"
"something seemed...off. So I was curious."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸君は駄目になってしまったのです。
msgctxt "0043 | CELES"
msgid "Taka has become utterly useless."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、セレスさん！　
#. そんな言い方って！
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Celeste! You don't have to say it like that!"
msgstr ""

#. この環境に耐えきれず、精神でも崩壊させたか？
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Did his spirit collapse or something? Was he unable to\n"
"withstand this environment?"
msgstr ""

#. 安い正義感を振りかざすヤツというのは、
#. 大抵弱いものだからな…
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Those men who clothe themselves in the cheap fabric of\n"
"justice are often the first to fall..."
msgstr ""

#. だが…お陰で面白い事になりそうだ。
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But perhaps that will make things all the more\n"
"interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. 面白い事って…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Interesting...?"
msgstr ""

#. 忠告しておいてやろう。
#. 偽りの仲間意識なんかを頼りにしない事だ…
msgctxt "0049 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Let me leave you with a bit of advice. Don't come to\n"
"rely on false camaraderie..."
msgstr ""

#. …手痛いしっぺ返しを食らうぞ。
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...or you'll reap its bitter reward."
msgstr ""

#. わざわざ…そんな嫌味言いに来たの？
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That's why you came? To give us that amazing \"advice\"?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら嫌われているようだな。
#. では、要望に応えて失礼するとしようか…
msgctxt "0052 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It seems I am unwelcome here. Then I will grant your\n"
"desire and remove myself..."
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、そうしましょう。
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Yeah, let's get outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. …お前は来なくていい。
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...You don't need to come with me."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、白夜様…ツンの時間がもったいないわ。
#. デレだけにしましょうよ。
msgctxt "0055 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You don't have to play hard to get, Master! You can\n"
"just play hard!"
msgstr ""

#. 話にならんな…
msgctxt "0056 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That doesn't make any sense..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンはそう言いながら、
#. ゆっくり体を反転させると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya started to slowly back out of the room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いきなり急加速し、
#. そのまま食堂を駆け抜けていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He started picking up speed, and soon he was sprinting\n"
"out of the dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 逃げた…？
msgctxt "0059 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "He ran away...?"
msgstr ""

#. ニゲデレなのね…なるほどね…
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So now he's *running* hard to get... I see!"
msgstr ""

#. 待て待て待て待てッ！
#. ギャーハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0061 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wait wait wait wait! Gyaaahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. え、えっとさ…結局のところ…
msgctxt "0062 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "S-So at the end there..."
msgstr ""

#. なんだったの…今のって…？
msgctxt "0063 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What was that all about?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の十神っちって…
#. ひょっとして、あれか？
msgctxt "0064 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Just now, Byakuya was like..."
msgstr ""

#. 非道キャラが展開変わる度に、
#. 性格変わったり、ヘタレになるパターン…
msgctxt "0065 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Maybe he's like the mean guy who starts acting\n"
"different or getting all flustered when things change!"
msgstr ""

#. …だな。
msgctxt "0066 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...Guess so."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残されたボクらは朝食を済ませると、
#. それぞれ、自分の部屋へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those of us left in the dining hall finished our\n"
"breakfast, then went back to our rooms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
